    "description": {
      "content": "The Doctave API provides programmatic access to manage documentation sites, deployments, pages, and search on the Doctave docs-as-code platform. It allows teams to automate documentation workflows, trigger deployments, manage site configurations, and integrate documentation search into their own applications and developer portals.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Doctave",
